 "identifier": "complex",
 "name": "Complex-valued forecasting: set α and the interval width",
 "alternateName": "Prévision complexe : régler α et la largeur des intervalles",
 "description": "A complex autoregression forecasts irradiance and its volatility. Set α, the share of measurements left outside the interval, and read μ, the multiplier that sets the width, Gaussian or calibrated; results of the paper (2022).",
 "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/complex-valued-forecasting/",
